# summary-breakdown.must-fail.patch
#
# Targets: tests/Playwright/e2e/e2e-tests/basket/summary-breakdown.spec.ts — the
# brand setting choosing between the two presentations (C1, C16, C17), which
# every other Scenario in that spec stands on.
# Authored by: developer seat (agent-seat-separation.companion.md — the seat that
# knows the exact line it changed authors the mutant; the prover applies it
# blind, confirms RED, then reverts — never reading src to construct it).
#
# Mutates ONE line: inverts the breakdown `v-if` in Summary.vue. The itemised
# region and the plain-totals region are the two arms of one v-if/v-else, so
# inverting the condition swaps them — the brand asks for details and is served
# plain totals, and the reverse. `data-test-key="basket-summary-breakdown"` sits
# INSIDE the mutated v-if, so the handle the spec selects by goes with it.
#
# Expected RED: 5 of 5.
#   - the four itemised-presentation tests: `summary.breakdown` never becomes
#     visible, so each fails at its first breakdown assertion.
#   - "shows plain totals only when the brand hides configuration details": the
#     totals list is not rendered AND `summary.breakdown` has count 1, not 0.
# Collateral, expected: checkout/summary-promotion-field.spec.ts reads the same
# v-if and flips too. Judge this control on the colocated spec.
#
# Apply / verify / revert:
#   git apply <this file>                          # mutate
#   pnpm exec playwright test tests/Playwright/e2e/e2e-tests/basket/summary-breakdown.spec.ts
#   git apply -R <this file>                       # revert — must return to green
#
--- a/packages/client-vue/src/modules/basket/components/Summary.vue
+++ b/packages/client-vue/src/modules/basket/components/Summary.vue
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
          priced from the saved server basket. Taxes read as calculating while a
          refresh is in flight — the basket carries none until it returns. -->
     <div
